# The sync script runs as the Codespace's postAttachCommand inside a Linux
# container, and students may also run it from a laptop. A CRLF checkout of
# a shell script fails on WSL and macOS bash ("$'\r': command not found"), so
# shell scripts are always LF whatever the platform's autocrlf setting.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Images are never line-ending-normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
